<title>USA: Micronics names Bill Finley CFO.</title>
<headline>Micronics names Bill Finley CFO.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Micronics Computers Inc said Wednesday it appointed Bill Finley vice president of finance and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The company said in a release that prior to joining Micronics, Finley was vice president of finance and administration and CFO at Vanguard Automation Inc of Tuscon, Arizona.</p>
<p>Finley, who has more than 30 years of experience in domestic and international finance, will oversee the company's control, treasury, investor relations and legal functions, Micronics said.</p>
</text>
